# Frontend native controls

```vue
<!-- BAD -->
<input class="custom-field" style="height: 42px" />

<!-- GOOD -->
<AppInput v-model="name" class="customer-input" />
```

- Reuse `--ds-control-*` for leftover classes
- Messenger inputs may stay raw if they match the same 48px inset geometry
- Do not restyle Market offer cards, meters, or hourglasses
